      "title": "夏日连战·Ⅱ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "32519001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "弗吉尼娅",
          "text": "你还能躲到什么时候？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32519002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "唔！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32519003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "弗吉尼娅",
          "text": "哼，用手臂挡下来了，但是……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32519004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "呜，好疼！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32519005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "柴可夫斯鸡",
          "text": "只是防御都很困难！即使徒手也依旧凶悍无比，这就是复仇弓矢的实力吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32519006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "弗吉尼娅",
          "text": "闭嘴！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32519007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "柴可夫斯鸡",
          "text": "明白！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32519008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿子",
          "text": "真乃的表情看上去很难受。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32519009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿子",
          "text": "好奇怪，弗吉尼娅的招式明明没有什么特别的……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32519010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32519011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "海伦",
          "text": "她的手上，附着「恶堕之弓」的诅咒之力。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32519012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "……只是身体接触，真乃就会受到诅咒的影响吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32519013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "海伦",
          "text": "是的，恐怕情况会越来越糟……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32519014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "弗吉尼娅",
          "text": "我很好奇，当你面临无法逾越的绝望，这精致的脸蛋上会浮现出什么样的表情。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32519015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "弗吉尼娅",
          "text": "你会像个普通的小女孩一样哇哇大哭吗，还是——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32519016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "弗吉尼娅",
          "text": "面如死灰地迎接自己的败局？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32519017",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "我，能看穿她的动作。",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32519018",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "只是这点痛苦的话……还能够忍受。",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32519019",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "呼……只是……要抓紧时间……",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32520001",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "绝对不能再让她的双手碰到……",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32520002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "柴可夫斯鸡",
          "text": "漂亮的闪躲！仓田选手避开了弗吉尼娅选手的拳势！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32520003",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "疼……脚已经麻了……",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32520004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "弗吉尼娅",
          "text": "啧，滑溜溜的跟沼泽里的怪鱼一样！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32520005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿子",
          "text": "真乃已经被逼到了擂台边缘了……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32520006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "海伦",
          "text": "愿光明守护着她。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32520007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "弗吉尼娅",
          "text": "真是难看的对决，该结束了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32520008",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "面对弗吉尼娅瞄准下巴而来的上勾拳，真乃矮下身——",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32520009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "弗吉尼娅",
          "text": "！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32520010",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "弗吉尼娅",
          "text": "居然抱住了我的腰？",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32520011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "柴可夫斯鸡",
          "text": "这是……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32520012",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "嘿——呀——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32520013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "弗吉尼娅",
          "text": "唔！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32520014",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "柴可夫斯鸡",
          "text": "竟然，会是这样的结果！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32520015",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "柴可夫斯鸡",
          "text": "弗吉尼娅选手，在出拳的瞬间被仓田选手抛下了擂台！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32520016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿子",
          "text": "这是……仓田流古武术的「腰回」。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32520017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "那是什么？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32520018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿子",
          "text": "是利用对方腰间空隙的投技……以前看会长用到过。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32520019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "柴可夫斯鸡",
          "text": "根据规则，掉出擂台者即为落败。因此，半决赛的获胜者是——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32520020",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "柴可夫斯鸡",
          "text": "仓田真乃选手！恭喜，获得了与「王者」对决的资格！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32520021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "柴可夫斯鸡",
          "text": "不得了，不得了，明天就是仓田流的兄妹间的内战了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32520022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "弗吉尼娅",
          "text": "可恶，真是取巧的小鬼。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32520023",
          "sourceType": 2,
          "speaker": "柴可夫斯鸡",
          "text": "要完，这个人生气了，得赶快向管理局求援……",
          "tone": "thought",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32520024",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "弗吉尼娅",
          "text": "啧，不过——至少比之前的那些废物要强。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32520025",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "谢谢你的认可，弗吉尼娅小姐。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32520026",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "终于……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32520027",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "真乃恍惚地抬起头，会场里雷动的掌声淹没了擂台上的少女。",
          "type": "narration"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-734",
