      "title": "夏日连战·Ⅲ"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "32521001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿子",
          "text": "真乃，恭喜恭喜，终于晋级到决赛了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32521002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "嗯，是啊。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32521003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "身体没事吧？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32521004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "不要紧，感觉好多了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32521005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿子",
          "text": "既然明天就要和会长决战了，让我来对你进行特训吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32521006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "欸？特训？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32521007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿子",
          "text": "没错，我会传授给你如何对付龙马的技巧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32521008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "哦……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32521009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿子",
          "text": "啊咧，怎么感觉真乃没有什么兴趣呢……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32521010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿子",
          "text": "这些对策都是我观察了很久会长的实战才得出来的结论。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32521011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿子",
          "text": "如果能够活用，不说战胜会长……至少也不会输得很难看。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32521012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "我……想要堂堂正正地和他决胜。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32521013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "所以不想选择这样的「捷径」。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32521014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿子",
          "text": "是吗，对不起，那就忘了我刚才说的吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32521015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "绿子……如果是你面临着一场重要的对决，你会怎么做？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32521016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿子",
          "text": "我吗？哈哈，我可不会想太多。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32521017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿子",
          "text": "吃好睡好，养足精神，然后在比赛的那一天，鼓足干劲上就完了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32521018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿子",
          "text": "最后无论是对方倒下还是我倒下，都无所谓！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32521019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "真是羡慕绿子的心态啊，我远没有你这样坚强……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32521020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "我现在有点……有点……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32521021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田真乃",
          "text": "抱歉，我想一个人静一下。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32521022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿子",
          "text": "啊？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32521023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿子",
          "text": "跑掉了……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32521024",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿子",
          "text": "我是不是说错什么话了？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32521025",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "可能她还没做好心理准备。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32521026",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿子",
          "text": "也是呢，毕竟对手是自己的哥哥。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32521027",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿子",
          "text": "明明晋级了决赛，但从获胜开始就是一副闷闷不乐的样子。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32521028",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "给她一点时间吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32521029",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿子",
          "text": "嗯，现在想来……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32521030",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿子",
          "text": "真乃这么主动地想挑战龙马，果然有什么深层的原因吧？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "32521032",
              "text": "家族内部的隔阂……"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "32521032",
              "text": "堂兄妹间的矛盾……"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "32521031",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "32521032",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿子",
          "text": "哎，听着就感觉头大。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "detail-735",
